  "DBOS retries every exception from a step until max_attempts is reached by default, and a should_retry filter can restrict retries to certain exceptions such as transient network errors rather than validation errors.": 1,
  "DBOS steps can be configured to retry any exception a set number of times with exponential backoff, via arguments to the step decorator.": 1,
  "If a DBOS step fails on all max_attempts attempts, it throws DBOSMaxStepRetriesExceeded to the calling workflow, and the workflow terminates if that exception is not caught.": 1
